# Complete equal-side and fallback classification web. The candidate keeps the
# selected value in v0/v1; retail uses t9/t0 and publishes it through side1's
# existing address-taken stack home. The ordinary/likely branch spellings have
# identical dynamic stores and delay-slot effects.
